id": 5373, "name": "urban", "slug": "urban", "language": "eng", "games_count": 36, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/dca/dcab709b5c9b939dfe7c33dfc537bc0f.jpg"}, {"id": 21309, "name": "streets", "slug": "streets", "language": "eng", "games_count": 6, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6f5/6f5c7815f239f3f425c2703aef176d11.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 38467, "name": "crea-ture Studios", "slug": "crea-ture-studios-inc", "games_count": 1, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/aba/abacd48c118ea106e27f1730f74e0e42.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Inspired by the golden era of skateboarding, the early 90s and early 2000, Session's primary goal is to make you experience what skateboarding really is; an incredible sport where there are no other goals other than expressing your creativity and achieving success through hard work, perseverance and bits of madness for no one else other than yourself.  The main purpose of the game is to live the sport in its entirety. Feel what it is to be a talented street skater.  Explore and tame the concrete, film yourself, your friends and share your footage on the internet with the worldwide skateboarding community.\nSession focuses on the authenticity of skating, both in the way the game feels and is presented to the player.  Based on this philosophy, each feature makes the game even more innovative, fun and respectful to the skateboarding culture."}